# Testing

Vitest 4 **browser mode** (Playwright Chromium) + `vitest-browser-react`.

## Struktur

| Lokasi | Tujuan |
|--------|--------|
| `src/test/integrations/*.spec.tsx` | Flow halaman end-to-end ringan |
| `src/test/units/**` | Logic murni, hooks, slice |
| `src/test/templates/*.spec.tsx` | Komponen template lokal |
| `src/pages/**/*.test.tsx` | Colocated (schema Zod, helper) |

## Render

```tsx
import { renderWithProviders } from '@/test/test-utils';

const screen = await renderWithProviders(<LoginPage />, { initialEntries: ['/login'] });
await expect.element(screen.getByRole('button', { name: 'LOGIN' })).toBeInTheDocument();
```

`renderWithProviders` = `KnittoProvider` + Redux + `MemoryRouter`.

## Interaksi

```tsx
import { userEvent } from 'vitest/browser';
const user = userEvent.setup();
await user.type(screen.getByPlaceholder('Username'), 'admin');
```

## MSW

Handler di `src/test/mocks/handlers/`. Setup: `onUnhandledRequest: 'error'`.

## Cakupan

| Test | Jangan test |
|------|-------------|
| Page flow, validasi form, navigasi | Komponen lib secara isolasi |
| Hook/slice/logic template | Implementasi internal react-ui |
| Komponen lokal (layout, form input) | — |

## Perintah

```bash
pnpm test          # watch
pnpm test:coverage # sekali jalan + coverage
```

Panduan lengkap: `src/test/README.md`
